                <custos xml:id="m-f8c4d0cf-bd6c-4e94-a865-f4f24cec3225" facs="#m-2f3f947c-dccd-47ea-9b28-9b93b9d9983f" pname="f" oct="3" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-fb1c15a6-71de-4e55-9625-0d9aeecdefb7">
              <lg xml:id="m-35a4068b-06b6-406c-a9a6-f92d303786da">
                <l xml:id="m-7970e726-d986-4b3b-89cd-195ff2526bf8" facs="#m-9b869c5b-4c22-4b54-9b0c-b552fe571b70" label="ambiguous">Ember Wednesday.</l><l xml:id="m-eebeaa84-41bb-470d-a05a-31ed27224f2e" facs="#m-6b5c2fde-01c3-485b-8294-eeaa56c94ef5" label="ambiguous">893</l><l xml:id="m-81af0619-b0dd-4ae8-94c4-dd7ca9e5c410" facs="#m-45578564-a6d4-45df-9062-98b920835182" label="lyrics-like">há- bi- tans in Il¬</l><l xml:id="m-6af04ad0-1b1a-4ae3-ae3b-092b0312346e" facs="#m-ff7fc001-13a6-46ec-99de-050010f7d11c" label="ambiguous">lis,</l><l xml:id="m-7b5243cd-94c1-4c90-bb00-bf085ad23b7e" facs="#m-257a6bc0-fe88-4a7e-b859-83afbcec0e8e" label="lyrics-like">alle-lú- ia, alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-9a5df6d5-08db-4efb-8f36-a126ca563444" facs="#m-db187b40-0283-4f88-84f7-31204dd07319" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia. Ps. Exsúrgat Dé-us, et dissipéntur inimí-ci é¬</l><l xml:id="m-73646fc8-0fc3-4991-ad5e-146f857dc419" facs="#m-21d28364-c0a0-440b-bd5b-09d6bec2b15d" label="lyrics-like">jus: * et fúgi-ant, qui odérunt é-um, a fá- ci- éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-189b40b2-a5dd-41a8-a047-111ccce34740" facs="#m-1279f876-5c1a-4981-a6bd-b983956b3119" label="lyrics-like">Gló-ri-a Pátri. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-ecb9355e-4b79-4adf-990f-88aaa8e85d5e" facs="#m-56291017-33be-4c08-9e5e-1452c5738cdc" label="lyrics-like">After the Kyrie eléison. the priest says Orémus. but Flectámus génua. i¬</l><l xml:id="m-1cabad45-5122-43bc-b98a-94ee11dfc8d3" facs="#m-a1ccffae-0bf6-4f5f-bd43-b77794d491cb" label="text-like">not said.</l><l xml:id="m-090f4975-28f7-493c-b2f9-11fd26e821a8" facs="#m-e0fe6ebe-4234-44d3-a419-58d480c47ac4" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-53d69409-2ff4-4812-81f9-b00d46a88017" facs="#m-c5cab8bd-cdad-4f9e-ab34-fb7efa90718d" label="lyrics-like">Entes nostras, quaésumus Dó- veritátem: Qui tecum vivit et re¬</l><l xml:id="m-5d525e34-a0ce-4157-b857-dd33b43a544f" facs="#m-6205016c-d0ba-426f-877d-181433b8ac1a" label="lyrics-like">310 mine, Paráclitus qui a te pro-gnat in unitáte ejúsdem Spiritus</l><l xml:id="m-604f2144-f87f-4060-b240-1ed7ac748946" facs="#m-f44c8f8b-8a4e-4239-8c80-09a580efe5f0" label="ambiguous">Sancti Deus.</l><l xml:id="m-77ef4c90-8785-460e-9822-c22f875e5aff" facs="#m-29ce0d39-118f-4d4a-b4f9-89d78e7a5202" label="lyrics-like">cédit, illúminet:“ et indúcat in</l><l xml:id="m-6f2ff592-dded-4aa3-b096-4e29a587ed92" facs="#m-e92bdc97-021d-4b3a-97e8-ff74ea187726" label="lyrics-like">omnem, sicut tuus promísit Filius,</l><l xml:id="m-36b5b568-b036-4ee8-9fe3-ea4a32ca6fc6" facs="#m-87270fe9-5305-4ed6-bd20-9df34208ff6c" label="ambiguous">Lectio Actuum Apostolorum. Act. 2. b.</l><l xml:id="m-8d5da5e8-3fc1-4709-8ab3-9209189f8149" facs="#m-26ad06fe-4f0a-4b83-9c73-809221e213d8" label="lyrics-like">TN diébus illis: Stans Petrus cum! vidébunt, et senióres vestri sómnia</l><l xml:id="m-8537bd19-30ee-4d2b-ba50-c5801ad0850d" facs="#m-790d2139-3299-494f-9d15-7abe66260d47" label="lyrics-like">somniábunt. Et quidem super servos</l><l xml:id="m-8cc647ee-106c-48f8-86c4-2ae0e6b857c9" facs="#m-123d882b-4aa7-4358-9e41-0e346c97c6a3" label="lyrics-like">I úndecim, levávit vocem suam,</l><l xml:id="m-b402ca67-7cf5-49c5-8786-4a8d40e6bfd5" facs="#m-8e933ce3-d3ae-4372-a312-579720f3f3b5" label="ambiguous">meos, et super ancillas meas in</l><l xml:id="m-e818c652-3bbd-46c0-8d02-c4a45be1aa2e" facs="#m-54f1282d-af81-45cd-9a45-a654e2904be8" label="lyrics-like">et locútus est eis: Viri Judaéi, et</l><l xml:id="m-07350d70-af52-4fe8-9dab-39425c8936a5" facs="#m-84647dd2-4b76-435d-9455-ec613eb85147" label="lyrics-like">diébus illis effúndam de Spiritu</l><l xml:id="m-fae93f69-b354-40d2-8f27-86b6c9f89d71" facs="#m-3d037dd5-8b8c-4687-a579-8ad371a15bf2" label="lyrics-like">qui habitátis Jerúsalem univérsi,</l><l xml:id="m-d644dba4-93b7-4495-aa40-da220fe23ddb" facs="#m-9ae33b99-b202-49f4-b23f-83cd9ae0bdb6" label="lyrics-like">meo, et prophetábunt: et dabõ pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-b28d6fc6-3114-48d6-9bf5-89d7ef54ca22" facs="#m-d012a240-434e-456d-8aef-41c4e3248fbd" label="lyrics-like">hoc vobis notum sit, et áuribus</l><l xml:id="m-c26a2b4b-a99c-44cd-8cb6-b0cc1ee0aa7f" facs="#m-826bd4b6-7f9d-40fe-90a6-cbb5b3823244" label="ambiguous">digia in caelo sursum, et signa in</l><l xml:id="m-88779dfe-c323-4d7e-9f95-3eb1fe09ec2a" facs="#m-efa1ba76-eb5d-47ef-a73f-e23874ab412b" label="lyrics-like">percípite verba mea. Non enim,</l><l xml:id="m-0c567050-4746-41e2-ae7b-f31134142f56" facs="#m-38f9325e-d309-448c-aa98-c313b18ccefd" label="lyrics-like">terra deórsum, sánguinem, et ignem,</l><l xml:id="m-bb9640ef-0032-4d9e-9c9d-83e0b18619ad" facs="#m-d427834d-a097-431d-87e2-9faf57ecb1c1" label="lyrics-like">sicut vos aestimátis, hi ébrii sunt,</l><l xml:id="m-4f3a6ab7-7d51-4b6d-bda4-ede48a84b7c6" facs="#m-52c7c776-c5ba-4fee-981f-8e3a7fe48413" label="lyrics-like">cum sit hora diéi tértia: sed hoc) et vapórem fumi. Sol convertẽtur in</l><l xml:id="m-29b2e6f9-7087-4937-a907-dd2d78d7abe0" facs="#m-2db63328-157e-47e0-8c04-7f8aff0ebe45" label="lyrics-like">ténebras, et luna in sánguinem,</l><l xml:id="m-4dc79ae8-384b-4c20-bde6-99b1a2e1c1a5" facs="#m-189f14e4-4919-4997-8063-c61a8766484b" label="lyrics-like">est, quod dictum est per prophétam</l><l xml:id="m-087c5980-c3f0-4f98-9b5e-a94ea226321c" facs="#m-a751e379-22d2-4d35-a348-a934a41c5a85" label="lyrics-like">ántequam véniat dies Dómini ma¬</l><l xml:id="m-0ececc8a-72aa-4c15-8898-0a9f37fa7cea" facs="#m-a3b4048a-6b97-44a8-9af9-e74fc0a16ec3" label="lyrics-like">Joél : Et erit in novíssimis diébus</l><l xml:id="m-a438b622-df8c-4f83-ac6f-c30d96f59b2a" facs="#m-81a5327b-3780-4ac6-93b5-3fc98ab2996b" label="lyrics-like">(dicit Dóminus) effúndam de Spiritu</l><l xml:id="m-2c3eb17c-9f73-445e-89d5-541f1a84454e" facs="#m-03ebd5d4-1332-44b8-9292-c595ed51e9f3" label="lyrics-like">gnus et maniféstus. Et erit : omnis</l><l xml:id="m-2bea2ade-94d4-461c-b247-f8577ec1defa" facs="#m-151eb9c2-1412-4af8-af37-2a25ee36136f" label="lyrics-like">quicúmque invocáverit nomen Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-0a1b01ba-aaac-4921-aff0-7a0e00711a33" facs="#m-5e688439-e664-43a4-befd-0421dc77ddba" label="ambiguous">meo super omnem carnem, et pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-cd3ca410-f0ab-4f42-be89-39be5766755a" facs="#m-b6b5910c-20eb-423e-8c76-95dd01e72df7" label="lyrics-like">phetábunt filii vestri, et filiae ve¬</l><l xml:id="m-9710cb86-ce9e-43e3-a25c-5c58821a6483" facs="#m-3b67a9a4-85fb-4297-976f-7cfb42fad282" label="ambiguous">mini, salvus erit.</l><l xml:id="m-638479ff-d08d-4c70-adf7-e4f5c14abbee" facs="#m-6cacb20e-1343-42de-8f19-29ee81326827" label="lyrics-like">strae, et júvenes vestri visiónes</l><l xml:id="m-8a996865-4844-4f55-b59d-4794647a10b6" facs="#m-dbc622d9-66e7-4c25-b338-27e017d68e86" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-c62d3615-4d3d-40ef-8f13-db9935e58219" facs="#m-f0543974-7b5b-4ae3-b6e4-7e2212ee1bc6" label="ambiguous">h</l><l xml:id="m-19dcd68b-c994-4ad5-8bab-2f50a6ec781f" facs="#m-2ba82da3-c197-4c44-9206-d413e095ef81" label="lyrics-like">v. Vérbo Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-b2effd1b-efdc-4298-9366-33398cd55f71" facs="#m-9e49470d-1bcf-4253-a6e1-6d72a37cad95" label="lyrics-like">Lle- lú-ia.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
